WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.232
A Common Table Expression begins with WITH Think of
it as a named intermediate

00:00:06.258 --> 00:00:11.838
relation inside one statement The first stage can
summarize or clean

00:00:11.864 --> 00:00:18.863
the source A later stage can join or enrich that
result The

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:24.410
final SELECT consumes the prepared data Naming the
stages helps

00:00:24.436 --> 00:00:27.371
you reason about the transformation one step at a
time
